    <node id="&quot;CARL REINHOLD ROTH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Carl Reinhold Roth was a Swedish businessman and ironmaster who lived during the late 17th to mid 18th century, known for his roles in various ironworks and estates, and his prominence in Stockholm."</data>
